let topicStudio={title:'M3挡泥板 · 八月专项分析',request:'聚焦挡泥板防护、甩泥、电池仓进水、安全担忧、售后诉求与改装适配。整合四来源反馈，形成态势总览、重点原声、问题洞察及建议行动。',entity_terms:'M3，M 3',keywords:'挡泥板，甩泥，电池仓进水，后仓进水',start:'2026-08-01',end:'2026-08-31',source:'',period:'monthly',busy:false,jobs:[],message:'',timer:null};
function renderTopicStudio(){
 const host=document.querySelector('#reports-content');if(!host)return;
 let panel=document.querySelector('#topic-studio');if(!panel){panel=document.createElement('section');panel.id='topic-studio';panel.className='b-card';host.prepend(panel)}
 panel.innerHTML=`<div class="b-panel-head"><div><div class="b-eyebrow">TOPIC REPORT STUDIO</div><h2>专项分析报告</h2></div><span class="b-tag">液态玻璃模板 · 模型分析</span></div><p class="b-note">描述分析需求，系统检索四来源原文，逐条精筛后生成“态势总览 / 重点内容 / 问题洞察”。图表由程序计算，结论由公司模型基于证据归纳。</p><form id="topic-form"><div class="report-basics"><label>专项报告标题<input name="title" maxlength="120" required value="${esc(topicStudio.title)}"></label><label>目标车型 / 对象及别名<input name="entity_terms" required maxlength="300" value="${esc(topicStudio.entity_terms)}" placeholder="例如 M3，M 3"></label></div><label class="topic-request-label">分析需求<textarea name="request" rows="3" required maxlength="2000">${esc(topicStudio.request)}</textarea></label><label class="topic-request-label">检索问题词（逗号分隔，可加入近义表达）<input name="keywords" required maxlength="400" value="${esc(topicStudio.keywords)}"></label><div class="report-basics"><label>开始日期<input name="start" type="date" min="2026-08-01" max="2026-08-31" required value="${esc(topicStudio.start)}"></label><label>结束日期<input name="end" type="date" min="2026-08-01" max="2026-08-31" required value="${esc(topicStudio.end)}"></label><label>来源<select name="source"><option value="">整合全部四来源</option>${[['wecom','企微社群'],['wechat_export','微信导出'],['voc','公域VOC'],['suggestions','意见建议']].map(([k,n])=>`<option value="${k}" ${topicStudio.source===k?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div><label class="topic-request-label">周期配置<select name="period">${[["daily","日报"],["weekly","周报"],["monthly","月报"]].map(([k,n])=>`<option value="${k}" ${topicStudio.period===k?"selected":""}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><div class="work-actions"><button type="submit" class="primary-button" ${topicStudio.busy?'disabled':''}>${topicStudio.busy?'正在提交…':'生成专项分析报告'}</button><button type="button" id="topic-save-plan">保存专项周期配置</button><button type="button" id="topic-refresh">刷新生成记录</button></div><p class="notice" id="topic-message" role="status">${esc(topicStudio.message)}</p></form><div id="topic-jobs"></div><h3>专项周期配置</h3><div id="topic-plans"></div><p class="b-note">以下保留基础统计报表及其历史周期配置。专项报告会另行分析所有检索命中记录，不复用一般风险等级作为情绪结论。</p>`;
 const form=document.querySelector('#topic-form');form.oninput=()=>{for(const [k,v]of new FormData(form))topicStudio[k]=v};
 form.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();if(topicStudio.busy)return;for(const[k,v]of new FormData(form))topicStudio[k]=v;topicStudio.busy=true;topicStudio.message='正在提交专项需求…';renderTopicStudio();try{const d=await api('api/topic-reports',{title:topicStudio.title,request:topicStudio.request,entity_terms:topicStudio.entity_terms,keywords:topicStudio.keywords,filters:{start:topicStudio.start,end:topicStudio.end,source:topicStudio.source}});topicStudio.message='任务已创建。可以留在此页查看进度，或稍后回来查看报告。';await loadTopicJobs()}catch(err){topicStudio.message=err.message}finally{topicStudio.busy=false;renderTopicStudio()}};
 document.querySelector('#topic-save-plan').onclick=saveTopicPlan;document.querySelector('#topic-refresh').onclick=()=>{loadTopicJobs();loadTopicPlans()};loadTopicPlans();renderTopicJobs();if(!topicStudio.loaded)loadTopicJobs();
}
function renderTopicJobs(){const host=document.querySelector('#topic-jobs');if(!host)return;host.innerHTML=topicStudio.jobs.map(j=>`<article class="schedule-card"><div class="b-panel-head"><h3>${esc(j.config.title)}</h3><span class="b-tag">${esc({queued:'排队中',running:'生成中',complete:'已生成',failed:'未完成',interrupted:'已中断'}[j.status]||j.status)}</span></div><p>${esc(j.config.filters.start)} — ${esc(j.config.filters.end)} · ${esc(j.stage)}</p>${j.total?`<p>已精筛 ${num(j.done)} / ${num(j.total)} 条${j.matched!=null?` · 纳入 ${num(j.matched)} 条相关原声`:''}</p>`:''}${j.error?`<p class="warning">${esc(j.error)}</p>`:''}${j.plan?`<details><summary>查看检索方案</summary><p>对象：${j.plan.entity_terms.map(esc).join(' / ')}<br>问题词：${j.plan.keywords.map(esc).join(' / ')}</p></details>`:''}${j.status==='complete'?`<div class="work-actions"><a class="primary-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="api/topic-reports/${encodeURIComponent(j.id)}/view">打开交互报告 ↗</a><a class="b-link" href="api/topic-reports/${encodeURIComponent(j.id)}/export?format=html" download>下载 HTML</a><a class="b-link" href="api/topic-reports/${encodeURIComponent(j.id)}/export?format=json" download>下载数据 JSON</a></div>`:''}</article>`).join('')||'<p class="notice">填写需求后，生成第一份专项分析报告。</p>'}
async function loadTopicJobs(){clearTimeout(topicStudio.timer);try{const d=await api('api/topic-reports');topicStudio.jobs=d.items;topicStudio.loaded=true;renderTopicJobs();if(d.items.some(j=>['queued','running'].includes(j.status)))topicStudio.timer=setTimeout(loadTopicJobs,4000)}catch(err){topicStudio.message=err.message;const el=document.querySelector('#topic-message');if(el)el.textContent=err.message}}

async function saveTopicPlan(){const f=document.querySelector('#topic-form');if(!f.reportValidity())return;for(const[k,v]of new FormData(f))topicStudio[k]=v;try{await api('api/topic-report-plans',{title:topicStudio.title,name:topicStudio.title,request:topicStudio.request,entity_terms:topicStudio.entity_terms,keywords:topicStudio.keywords,period:topicStudio.period,filters:{start:topicStudio.start,end:topicStudio.end,source:topicStudio.source}});document.querySelector('#topic-message').textContent='专项周期配置已保存。点击模拟运行，按各周期分别生成分析报告。';loadTopicPlans()}catch(e){document.querySelector('#topic-message').textContent=e.message}}
async function loadTopicPlans(){const el=document.querySelector('#topic-plans');if(!el)return;try{const d=await api('api/topic-report-plans');el.innerHTML=d.items.map(p=>`<article class="schedule-card"><h3>${esc(p.name)} · ${esc({daily:'日报',weekly:'周报',monthly:'月报',custom:'自定义'}[p.period])}</h3><p>${esc(p.config.filters.start)} — ${esc(p.config.filters.end)}</p><p class="b-note">模拟各周期读取本地历史数据，逐条精筛并生成模型分析报告；不会发送真实通知。</p><button class="primary-button" data-topic-plan="${esc(p.id)}">模拟周期运行</button>${p.last_run?`<p>最近运行：${esc({running:'生成中',complete:'已完成',partial:'部分完成'}[p.last_run.status]||p.last_run.status)} · ${p.last_run.job_ids.length} 个周期，报告见上方生成记录</p>`:''}</article>`).join('')||'<p class="notice">尚未保存专项周期配置。</p>';el.querySelectorAll('[data-topic-plan]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{b.disabled=true;try{await api('api/topic-report-plans/'+b.dataset.topicPlan+'/run',{});await loadTopicJobs();loadTopicPlans()}catch(e){document.querySelector('#topic-message').textContent=e.message;b.disabled=false}})}catch(e){el.textContent=e.message}}
